  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Having to go in and toggle nameplates on just to check who someone is first is cumbersome, but not quite as cumbersome as trying to hover your controller over someone buried in a group of people.\nAn easy solution would be allow an option that only shows nameplates when your menu is open, so that way you can have your immersive experience without quietly crying as you try to figure out who someone is.",
